ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;\n-  cardiovascular diseases;\n-  use of anabolic, anti-inflammatory and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;\n-  use of alcohol and illicit drugs during the collection period;\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;",\n              "Observation": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "musculoskeletal"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "last three months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "last"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "three"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- cardiovascular diseases;",\n              "Condition": [\n                "cardiovascular diseases"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "cardiovascular diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- use of anabolic,",\n              "Drug": [\n                "anabolic"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "anabolic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "anti-inflammatory",\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "anti-inflammatory"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "anti-inflammatory"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "72 hours"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "72"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "hours"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "analgesic drugs"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "analgesic drugs"\n                  ],\n                  "Study": [\n                    "evaluations"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- use of alcohol",\n          "Drug": [\n            "alcohol"\n          ],\n          "Drug-Name": [\n            "alcohol"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and illicit drugs during the collection period;",\n          "Drug": [\n            "illicit drugs"\n          ],\n          "Drug-Name": [\n            "illicit drugs"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
