ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  (1) gestational age 35 to 39 weeks\n-  (2) adults\n-  (3) primipara and their spouses\n-  (4) having routine prenatal visits and plan to have the birth in the medical center\n-  (5) able to communicate with Mandarin or Taiwanese\n-  (6) willing to participate in this study and give written inform-consent forms\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- (1) gestational age 35 to 39 weeks",\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "gestational age"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "35 to 39 weeks"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "gestational age"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Value": [\n                                        "35",\n                                        "39"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                        "to"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                        "weeks"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- (2) adults",\n                                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                        "adults"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- (3)",\n                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                        "to"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "NOT": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "primipara and their spouses",\n                                          "Condition": [\n                                            "primipara"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Condition-Name": [\n                                            "primipara"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Negation": [\n                                            "primipara"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Family-Member": [\n                                            "spouses"\n                                          ]\n                                        }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- (4) having routine prenatal visits and plan to have the birth in the medical center",\n                              "Encounter": [\n                                "prenatal visits"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "to"\n                              ],\n                              "Location": [\n                                "medical center"\n                              ],\n                              "Birth": [\n                                "birth"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "plan"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "- (5) able to communicate with Mandarin or Taiwanese",\n                          "Language": [\n                            "Mandarin",\n                            "Taiwanese"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- (6) willing to participate in this study and give written inform-consent forms",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "to"\n                      ]\n                    }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- (7) willing to participate in this study",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "to"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- (8) willing to participate in this study",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "to"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
