ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients undergoing a TAVI at Montpellier University Hospital\n-  Since November 2017\n-  With implantation of a COREVALVE or EDWARDS\n-  By femoral approach\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients undergoing a TAVI at Montpellier University Hospital",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "TAVI"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "TAVI"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "undergoing"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "undergoing"\n              ],\n              "Location": [\n                "Montpellier University Hospital"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Since November 2017",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "Since"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Recency": [\n                "Since"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "November 2017"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "November 2017"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- With implantation of a COREVALVE",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "implantation"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "implantation"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "COREVALVE"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or EDWARDS",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "EDWARDS"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "By femoral approach",\n      "Modifier": [\n        "femoral approach"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
