ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Cochlear Nucleus cochlear implant users or Advanced Bionics cochlear implant users\n-  Native speakers of English\n-  Early onset of deafness (< 3 years of age); no requirement for age at implantation\n-  Late onset of deafness (> 3 years of age); matched in duration of deafness to the early onset group\n-  Has had device experience for at least one year\n-  Can be child or adult at the time of enrollment\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Cochlear Nucleus cochlear implant users",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "Cochlear Nucleus cochlear implant"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "Cochlear Nucleus cochlear implant"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or Advanced Bionics cochlear implant users",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "Advanced Bionics cochlear implant"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "Advanced Bionics cochlear implant"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Native speakers of English",\n                              "Language": [\n                                "English"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Early onset of deafness (< 3 years of age);",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "deafness"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "deafness"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "<"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                "years"\n                              ],\n                              "Age": [\n                                "age"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "3"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "< 3 years"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "Early onset"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "no requirement for age at implantation",\n      