ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Presence of uncontrolled diabetes mellitus,\n-  Presence of uncontrolled hypertension,\n-  Presence of uncontrolled lipid metabolism disorders,\n-  Presence of neurological diseases,\n-  Presence of heamatological diseases,\n-  Urinary tract infection,\n-  Diagnosis of any malignencies,\n-  Chronic kidney failure,\n-  Presence of metabolic syndrome,\n-  Presence of psychiatric diseases and/or medical treatment,\n-  Smoking,\n-  History of pelvic surgery, cardiac surgery and pelvic radiotherapy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "AND": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "AND": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "AND": {\n 