ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Previous history of hypertension, diabetes mellitus, Dyslipidemia\n-  Previous history of cardiovascular or cerebrovascular events\n-  Autoimmune, Neoplastic diseases\n-  Thromboembolic diseases\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Previous history of hypertension, diabetes mellitus, Dyslipidemia",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "hypertension",\n                    "diabetes mellitus",\n                    "Dyslipidemia"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "hypertension",\n                    "diabetes mellitus",\n                    "Dyslipidemia"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Previous history"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "Previous history"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Previous history of cardiovascular",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "Previous history"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "Previous history"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "cardiovascular"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or cerebrovascular events",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "cerebrovascular"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "events"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "events"\n                      ]\n                    }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Autoimmune,",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "Autoimmune"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "Neoplastic diseases",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Neoplastic diseases"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Neoplastic diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "Thromboembolic diseases",\n      "Condition": [\n        "Thromboembolic diseases"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "Thromboembolic diseases"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
Response: {
