ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Treatment-seeking cigarette smoker\n-  Meet DSM-IV criteria for nicotine dependence\n-  Negative result on urine test for drug use during screening\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Treatment-seeking cigarette smoker",\n          "Observation": [\n            "cigarette smoker"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "cigarette smoker"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "Treatment-seeking"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Meet DSM-IV criteria for nicotine dependence",\n          "Condition": [\n            "nicotine dependence"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "nicotine dependence"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "to"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "I"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "I"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "DSM-IV"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Negative result on urine test for drug use during screening",\n      "Observation": [\n        "urine test"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "urine test"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "to"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "I"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "I"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "screening"\n      ],\n      "Polarity": [\n        "Negative"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "drug use"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "drug use"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
