ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Physical limitations (e.g., restricting injuries of the musculoskeletal system, or dependent of a third person).\n-  Exercise-related dyspnoea or respiratory alterations.\n-  Chronic heart disease with any worsening in the last month.\n-  Adherence rate of less than 80% of the total interventions.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Physical limitations (e.g., restricting injuries of the musculoskeletal system,",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "Physical limitations",\n                    "injuries"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "Physical limitations",\n                    "injuries"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "musculoskeletal system"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "restricting"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "restricting"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or dependent of a third person).",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "dependent"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "dependent"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "third person"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Exercise-related dyspnoea",\n              "Condition": [\n                "dyspnoea"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "dyspnoea"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "Exercise"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Exercise"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "related"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or respiratory alterations.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "respiratory alterations"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "respiratory alterations"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Chronic heart disease",\n      "Condition": [\n        "heart disease"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "heart disease"\n      ],\n      "Acuteness": [\n        "Chronic"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
