ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Male participants who are between the ages of 21 and 65 years (inclusive) on the day of signing informed consent\n-  Diagnosis of active rheumatoid arthritis, psoriatic arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis or, non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis for at least 12 weeks prior to screening, meeting the corresponding specific disease classification criteria as specified in the protocol\nKey\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Male participants",\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "Male"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "who are between the ages of 21 and 65 years (inclusive) on the day of signing informed consent",\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "age"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "21",\n            "65",\n            "1"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "between the ages of 21 and 65 years (inclusive)"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "between"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "on"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of active rheumatoid arthritis,",\n          "Condition": [\n            "rheumatoid arthritis"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "rheumatoid arthritis"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "active"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "psoriatic arthritis,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "psoriatic arthritis"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "psoriatic arthritis"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "ankylosing spondylitis",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "ankylosing spondylitis"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "ankylosing spondylitis"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "or,",\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "on"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "NOT": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis for at least 12 weeks prior to screening, meeting the corresponding specific disease classification criteria as specified in the protocol",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "spondyloarthritis"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "spondyloarthritis"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "weeks"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "12"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "at least 12 weeks"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "at least"\n                          ],\n                          "M