text" fields contain the actual text of the criterion. The raw text must always be transferred in full.\n- Additional fields such as "Drug", "Condition", "Observation" or "Age"  can appear next to "raw_text" to categorise specific terms.\n\n4. Extract the following entities from the raw text and include them in the JSON object:\nNodes could include attributes such as:\n- "raw_text": A string representing the raw text description of the medical condition, procedure, or other relevant details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients under tutorship or curatorship or inability to give informed consent\n-  Patients receiving an anti-osteoporotic treatment\n-  Patients requiring an anti-osteoporotic baseline treatment (T-score ⩽ -3DS on at least 1 site or FRAX score above the therapeutic intervention threshold)     \n-  Patients with one or more major risk factors for osteoporosis\n-  Patients who have received topical corticosteroids in less than 3 months\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Patients under tutorship",\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "tutorship"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "tutorship"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "or curatorship or inability to give informed consent",\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "curatorship"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "curatorship"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Assertion": [\n                                        "inability"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Patients receiving an anti-osteoporotic treatment",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "treatment"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "osteoporotic"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "osteoporotic"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "receiving"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "receiving"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "anti"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Patients requiring an anti-osteoporotic baseline treatment (T-score ⩽ -3DS on at least 1 site or FRAX score above the therapeutic intervention threshold)",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "treatment"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "osteoporotic"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "osteoporotic"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "⩽",\n                                "at least"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "3",\n                                "1",\n                                "3DS"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "⩽ -3DS",\n                                "at least 1 site"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "receiving"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "anti",\n                                "baseline"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "T-score",\n                                "FRAX score"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "T-score",\n                                "FRAX score"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "requiring"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Patients with one or more major risk factors for osteoporosis",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "osteoporosis"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "osteoporosis"\n                          ],\n                          "Risk": [\n                            "risk factors"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "one or more"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "one"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "or more"\n                          ],\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "major"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients who have received topical corticosteroids in less than 3 months",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "less than"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "received"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "3"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "received",\n                        "less than 3 months"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "topical corticosteroids"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "topical corticosteroids"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "months"\n                      ]\n                    }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with a history of other diseases, conditions, or behaviors that may either put the patient at risk because of participation in the study, or may either confound the study results, or the patient\'s ability to participate in the study",\n          "Condition": [\n            "diseases",\n            "conditions"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Study": [\n            "study"\n          ],\n          "Risk": [\n            "risk"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "may"\n          ],\n          "Other": [\n            "other"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "behaviors"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "behaviors"\n          ],\n          "Stability": [\n            "confound"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients who are hypersensitive to needles",\n      "Condition": [\n        "hypersensitive"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "hypersensitive"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "to needles"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
