ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Age between 25 years and 60 years\n-  For the volunteers with venous insuffiency: clearly visual venous insufficiency (CEAP 1 and 2)\n-  BMI between 24 and 30\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Age between 25 years and 60 years",\n          "Age": [\n            "Age"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "between 25 years and 60 years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "between"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years",\n            "year"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "25",\n            "60"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- For the volunteers with venous insuffiency: clearly visual venous insufficiency (CEAP 1 and 2)",\n          "Condition": [\n            "venous insuffiency",\n            "venous insufficiency"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "venous insuffiency",\n            "venous insufficiency"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "venous"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "CEAP 1 and 2"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "CEAP 1 and 2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "1 and 2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "1",\n            "2"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "clearly visual"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- BMI between 24 and 30"