ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  18 to 95 years of age\n-  Participation in WAVES Project for at least 3 months\n-  Completion of 3 open water dives\n-  Proficient in written and verbal English\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- 18 to 95 years of age",\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "age"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "18",\n                "95"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "18 to 95 years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "to"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Participation in WAVES Project for at least 3 months",\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "3"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "at least 3 months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "at least"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "WAVES Project"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Completion of 3 open water dives",\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "3"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "3"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "open water dives"\n          