ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. HIV-positive adolescents aged 10-19 years who know their status\n2. On ART for at least 6 months as per clinic records: the patient will have attended the clinic as shown in clinic records at least once since initiation AND will have re-filled their ART at least once since initiation as shown in clinic records..\n3. Planning to stay in care at that facility for at least 12 months\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "1. HIV-positive adolescents aged 10-19 years",\n              "Condition": [\n                "HIV"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "HIV"\n              ],\n              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                "adolescent"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "aged"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "10",\n                "19"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "10-19 years"\n              ],\n              "Polarity": [\n                "positive"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "who know their status",\n              "Condition": [\n                "status"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "status"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "know"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "2. On ART for at least 6 months as per clinic records: the patient will have attended the clinic as shown in clinic records at least once since initiation AND will have re-filled their ART at least once since initiation as shown in clinic records..",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "at least"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "months"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "6"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "at least 6 months"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "ART"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "ART"\n          ],\n          "Encounter": [\n            "attended",\n            "re-filled"\n          ],\n          "Location": [\n            "clinic"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Recency": [\n            "initiation"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "initiation"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "3. Planning to stay in care at that facility for at least 12 months",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "at least"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "months"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "12"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "at least 12 months"\n      ],\n      "Encounter": [\n        "stay in care"\n      ],\n      "Location": [\n        "facility"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "Planning"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
